    "https://careers.compass-usa.com/veterans": {
      "title": "Mission Driven\n                        Careersat Compass\n                                                      Group",
      "description": "Veterans Careers at Compass Group Sign In Current Employees Talent Community Careers\n                                    Home Why Compass? Benefits Awards Career Growth Recognition About US COI Sustainability Veterans Who we are Career Areas Operations Corporate Roles Students\n                                    & Grads Job Search Click to search Careers Home Why Compass? Benefits Awards Career Growth Recognition About Us COI Sustainability Veterans Who We Are Career Areas Operations Corporate Roles Students & Grads Sign In Job Search Mission Driven\n                        Careers at Compass\n                                                      Group Translate your military occupation code or discover something\n                        entirely new! I'm Looking For Position near Search THE RIGHT CHOICE FOR A SECOND CAREER Whether you’re currently serving in our nation’s military, or just finished your tour of duty,\n                        or even served in the military\n                        and are already in the civilian sector, we want to help you find a home within Compass Group\n                        that maximizes your unique skillset\n                        and honors your experiences. DOD SKILLBRIDGE From deployment to employment, Compass Group provides mentorship opportunities and\n                                tailored programs for veterans seeking a\n                                new chapter... Read more MSEP Compass Group US is proud to announce its partnership with the Military Spouse Employment\n                            Partnership (MSEP), a\n                            Department of Defense initiative aimed at connecting military spouses with employers\n                            committed to recruiting, hiring,\n                            and retaining them. This partnership underscores Compass Group’s dedication to supporting\n                            military families and\n                            recognizing the unique skills and experiences that military spouses bring to the work force. To learn more about Compass Group’s MSEP program, please contact Dawn Lyons at dawn.lyons@compass-usa.com . Hear from our veterans PATRICK DUGAN Project Director, Strategic Projects Leading with Core Values and Teamwork “Compass Group was described to me as a people first culture, driven by\n                                            mission and a collective pursuit of perfection\n                                            through a team of teams approach. Those words illustrated what any Veteran\n                                            would call Core Values and the promise they\n                                            made is one that is honored daily. Today, I'm proud to lead a team working\n                                            to simplify processes, systems, and\n                                            communications for operators in the field.” DONNA TURNER VP, Government Engagement & Sales Proud to Support Veterans and Be Part of\n                                            the Compass Group Family I'm proud to work for a company that continues to support Veterans and the\n                                            military-connected community. The family of\n                                            Compass Group and its culture is phenomenal, and I'm honored to be a part of\n                                            this organization RAINE HOLLY Regional Wellness Director, Eurest Supporting veterans transitioning to\n                                            civilian careers “Compass Group VetNet holds significant importance to me because it plays a\n                                            pivotal role in supporting veterans\n                                            transitioning to civilian careers, including those currently serving as\n                                            reservists. The program provides essential\n                                            resources that enable these dedicated individuals to find meaningful\n                                            employment and successfully reintegrate into\n                                            civilian life.” BRENDA KEMP Southeast Division Food Safety Manager, Canteen Grateful for the opportunities, trust,\n                                            and confidence provided to all Veterans “At Compass, I have a fantastic leadership team that supports my career\n                                            development and recognizes my contributions. I\n                                            am deeply grateful for the opportunities, trust, and confidence provided to\n                                            all Veterans.” Chevron left icon Chevron right icon About Us It takes a special team to deliver world-class hospitality and\n                            support services on a stage this big. Learn more WHY COMPASS? Benefits, career growth, recognition and more — there are so many\n                            reasons to choose a career at Compass Group. Learn more CAREER AREAS Build a great career in hospitality or support services, or join the\n                            team behind the scenes at our corporate headquarters. Learn more JOIN our FAMILY Your future is waiting. Let’s get started. Search Jobs Careers Home Hiring\n              Events Talent Community Search Jobs Compass-USA.com Current Employees Why Compass? Awards Benefits Career Growth Recognition About Us Inclusion and Belonging Sustainability Veterans Who We Are Career Areas Corporate Field Students & Grads Internships Accelerated Manager Program © 2025 Compass Group North America Applicants with Disabilities Code of Business Conduct Contact Us Employment Posters & Forms Equal Opportunity Employer Privacy Policy Privacy Requests Terms of Use"
    }
